    "title": "Charlotte Man Who Pistol-Whipped, Shot at Victim Gets Just 44 Days in Jail - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Carlos Hernandez ,\n9 hours ago A 21-year-old Charlotte man who struck another man twice in the head with a pistol and then fired at him as he fled will spend just 44 days behind bars. Jamario Smith pleaded guilty to assault with a deadly weapon over the February 24, 2025 attack on Parkwood Avenue, and a judge handed down the 44-day jail sentence at his 2026 trial. Read full article\n6",
